// The last will and testament of Margaret Ellis (will.md).
Document "will.md"

Fact person Identified by Margaret, Daniel, Priya, Anna, Ben, Shelter
Placeholder witness For person
Placeholder executor For person
Placeholder beneficiary For person
Fact asset Identified by House, Cash
Fact earlier-will
Param survivorship : Duration = 30

// W.2 Execution: signed, and witnessed by two
Bool signed
Fact witnessed Identified by witness
Bool in-effect
  Holds when signed() && Count(Foreach witness: witness When witnessed()) >= 2
Act sign Actor person Holds when person == Margaret Creates signed()
Act attest Actor witness Holds when signed() && witness != Margaret Creates witnessed()

// W.1 Revocation
Fact revoked Identified by earlier-will
  Holds when in-effect()

// W.3 Executor: Daniel, or Priya if Daniel cannot act; authority begins at death
Fact deceased Identified by person
Fact declined Identified by person
Fact lapsed Identified by beneficiary
Event death Related to person
  Creates deceased(person)
        , lapsed(person) When person != Margaret && Not(Held(deceased(Margaret)) For survivorship)
Act decline Actor executor Creates declined(executor)
Fact acting Identified by executor
  Default named-executor Holds when executor == Daniel
  Exception daniel-cannot-act Overrides named-executor
    Rejects when executor == Daniel && (declined(Daniel) || deceased(Daniel))
  Default substitute-executor
    Holds when executor == Priya && (declined(Daniel) || deceased(Daniel))

// W.4 Debts
Fact debt Identified by string
Act pay-debt Actor executor Related to string
  Holds when acting() && debt()
  Terminates debt()

// W.5 to W.7 Gifts, survivorship, residue
Fact named Identified by asset * beneficiary
Fact failed Identified by asset
  Holds when (Exists beneficiary: named() && (lapsed() || witnessed(beneficiary)))
Fact entitled Identified by asset * beneficiary
  Holds when (named() && Not(failed())) || (beneficiary == Shelter && failed())
Fact received Identified by asset * beneficiary
Act distribute Actor executor Recipient beneficiary Related to asset
  Holds when Not(Exists debt: debt)
  Valid when in-effect() && acting() && entitled()
    && Held(deceased(Margaret)) For survivorship
  Creates received()

Clause W.1 Approved "1e4c1ed572d11d48d82d18347045ad221a8a3d829c579d7e202234c9d312a284"
  Definition "I revoke every will I made before this one."
Clause W.2 Approved "7b112f6fdaefdafc391145a75313a9b5db25b8d89d8083d81da452a8fe5e3e41"
  Norm "This will takes effect only if I sign it in the presence of two witnesses who each sign it too." => sign, attest
  Norm " A gift to a person who witnessed this will is void." => distribute
Clause W.3 Approved "dcdd71845a81616f5516f6a623886fe6d0f1e96263d6c2ed3ad398cbfd498884"
  Norm "I appoint Daniel Ellis as my executor. If Daniel is unable or unwilling to act, I appoint Priya Shah in his place." => decline, distribute
  Norm " The executor's authority begins at my death." => distribute
Clause W.4 Approved "c9c08d18d69e20b7aae3fcd564222c5df5e30f65ff846a6b4cfbd26dd2834bc1"
  Norm "The executor pays my debts before distributing any gift." => pay-debt, distribute
Clause W.5 Approved "662bd645730a1733126caef1af2789487bcbdb9fc8db9029f2ce7e146cf5d641"
  Norm "I give my house to Anna Ellis. I give twenty thousand dollars to Ben Ellis." => distribute
Clause W.6 Approved "4b0e28d12cb5ca0e0fe6e5373a581a7b0dfc69d0ab84c0f2e0a8010d8e9b66ed"
  Norm "A beneficiary who does not survive me by thirty days is treated as having died before me, and that beneficiary's gift falls into the residue." => distribute
Clause W.7 Approved "038e22a02bb7ba75329821f86d4cbfef90e066693152b223d08c7fd77fe109c6"
  Norm "I give the rest of my estate to the Harbor Animal Shelter." => distribute
.
+named(House, Anna). +named(Cash, Ben).
